  "description": "A Coast Guard MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew from Air Station Kodiak hoists a 35-year-old hypothermic crewman from the deck of the 58-foot Kodiak-based fishing vessel Stella in Shelikof Strait, Alaska, March 15, 2013. There is no audio for this video.  \r\n\r\nThe man fell overboard from the vessel earlier in the day and was recovered from the ocean by the remaining crew after 25 minutes in the 37.6 degree water. \r\n\r\nU.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Kodiak.",
